## Structure

```
src/main/java/com/example/project/
├── Application.java                    ← entry point
├── errors/                             ← global error handling
├── shared/                             ← cross-cutting concerns
│   ├── database/                       ← ORM setup
│   ├── cache/                          ← Redis config
│   ├── auth/                           ← JWT security
│   ├── health/                         ← health endpoints
│   ├── kafka/                          ← Kafka config
│   └── rabbitmq/                       ← RabbitMQ config
├── domain/<module>/                    ← entity + repository interface
│   ├── <Module>.java
│   └── <Module>Repository.java
├── application/<module>/               ← use case implementations
│   └── <Module>UseCase.java
├── infrastructure/<module>/            ← JPA/adapter implementations
│   ├── <Module>JpaRepository.java
│   └── <Module>RepositoryAdapter.java
└── presentation/<module>/              ← REST controllers + DTOs
    ├── <Module>Controller.java
    └── <Module>Dto.java
```

## Commands

```bash
./mvnw spring-boot:run              # dev server on :8080
{{#if useDocker}}
docker compose up -d                # start databases/brokers
docker compose down
{{/if}}
{{#if useCheckstyle}}
./mvnw checkstyle:check             # lint
{{/if}}
{{#if useTests}}
./mvnw test                         # run tests
{{/if}}
```

